  data: {
    LLM: 'Bower Power: Only order up if you hold the Right Bower, OR the Left Bower plus Ace of trump. Ordering up with 2 small trump and no Bower is very risky.\n\nSuit Control: Pay attention to the suits your partner playsâ€”if they lead a high off-suit card, they likely have a void in trump (signaling strength). Counter-order: Order up from the 3rd or 4th seat only if you can cover your partnerâ€”the 4th-seat order is the safest.\n\nGoing Alone Threshold: Go alone with Right Bower + Left Bower + Ace of trump + any other trump = near-certain sweep. Any less and the Euchre risk is high. Partner Signals: The opening lead of the highest card in a suit signals a void in that suit (asking partner to trump it).',
